# This is a Linux-targeted project — keep line endings LF in the repo
# regardless of a contributor's local git config, so shell scripts
# (whose shebang breaks with a trailing \r) and everything else behave
# identically on Linux, which is the only place most of this ever runs.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.sh text eol=lf
postinst text eol=lf
PKGBUILD text eol=lf
anonveil.install text eol=lf
